vancing the understanding and management of nutritional needs in patients with liver disease.", "ALLISON SP:Allison SP is an author of the ESPEN guidelines for nutrition screening.", "ELIA M:Elia M is a prominent researcher in the field of nutrition, particularly known for her contributions to nutritional screening and interventions. She is a co-author of the Malnutrition Universal Screening Tool (MUST) and has played a significant role in developing the ESPEN guidelines for nutrition screening. Her research primarily focuses on the impact of nutritional interventions on health outcomes in older adults. Additionally, Elia M has authored a systematic review on enteral nutritional support in cancer patients and has studied the effects of oral glutamine supplementation in patients undergoing bone marrow transplants. Furthermore, she has contributed to a systematic review and meta-analysis of fibre-containing enteral formulae, highlighting her extensive involvement in advancing nutritional research and practice.", "VELLAS B:Vellas B is a prominent researcher specializing in the fields of frailty and aging. He has made significant contributions to the development and review of the Mini Nutritional Assessment, which is widely used in clinical settings to evaluate nutritional status. Additionally, Vellas B is an author of the ESPEN guidelines for nutrition screening, further underscoring his expertise and influence in the area of nutritional assessment and its applications in healthcare.", "PLAUTH M:Plauth M is a prominent author and researcher in the field of nutrition, particularly in relation to liver disease. He has made significant contributions to the ESPEN (European Society for Clinical Nutrition and Metabolism) guidelines, specifically focusing on parenteral nutrition in hepatology and enteral nutrition in liver disease. Additionally, Plauth M has conducted research on cachexia in liver cirrhosis, further highlighting his expertise and commitment to improving nutritional care for patients with liver conditions. His work in developing guidelines for nutrition screening also underscores his role in advancing clinical practices in this area.", "MUELLER C:Mueller C is a researcher who has made significant contributions to the field of nutrition, particularly in the development of clinical guidelines. They are notably recognized as an author of the ASPEN clinical guidelines for nutrition screening and assessment, which serve as a vital resource for healthcare professionals in evaluating and addressing nutritional needs.", "ELLEN DM:Ellen DM is an author of the ASPEN clinical guidelines for nutrition screening.", "OLIVEIRA FUSTER G:Oliveira Fuster G is a researcher focused on the supply of dietary-therapeutic products within a university hospital setting. In addition to their research, Oliveira Fuster G is recognized as an author referenced in bibliographies concerning nutritional requirements. They have specifically contributed to the updated nutritional requirements for older adults and have made significant contributions to the literature on nutritional requirements and diet therapy.", "GONZALO MARTÍN M:Gonzalo Martín M is an author referenced in the bibliography regarding nutritional requirements.", "CARRAL SAN LAUREANO F:Carral San Laureano F is an author referenced in the bibliography regarding nutritional requirements.", "RABITO EI:Rabito EI is an author referenced in the bibliography regarding validation of predictive equations for weight and height.", "MIALICH MS:Mialich MS is an author referenced in the bibliography regarding validation of predictive equations for weight and height.", "MARTÍNEZ EZ GARCÍA RW:Martínez EZ García RW is an author referenced in the bibliography regarding validation of predictive equations for weight and height.", "JORDÃO AA JR:Jordão AA Jr is an author referenced in the bibliography regarding validation of predictive equations for weight and height.", "MARCHINI JS:Marchini JS is an author referenced in the bibliography regarding validation of predictive equations for weight and height."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}